### Work In Progress

This repository is an on-going work in progress personal project. The purpose of this project is:
- to allow me to hand type the Bible (a personal goal)
- to compile both txt files and, in the future, binary files of copyright free Bibles for use in coding projects
- to use the Bibles typed here for two other planned personal projects:
  - a CLI Bible memorization tool written in Rust
  - a GUI Bible study tool written in Rust

The repository is closed to contributions.
